msgid "Optional folder on a USB stick (e.g. <code>/mnt/sda1</code>, mounted via System → Mount Points). <code>/tmp/isp-tester</code> becomes a link to it, so the timeline, history and CSV survive a reboot. Written: every event, the history once a minute, one CSV line per interval. Do not use the internal flash. Empty = RAM."
